note Omega Surface Language V0 (lane 3) test suite and golden verifier. It carries NO copy of
note the front end: the make rule (mk/visor-language.mk) concatenates the shipped
note src/visor/visor.om, the shared units, src/visor/visor_program.om and
note src/language/omega_lex.om, omega_parse.om, omega_lower.om (the sources `omega` is built
note from) ahead of this file, so every check below runs the shipped lexer, parser and lowering.
note This file holds only the vectors, the checks and a thin adapter over the shipped entry points.
om2

